[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    164[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    165[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // The C program's entire observable input is the first byte of stdin, or the
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    166[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // absence of one. Each test below pins an input class the C source branches on.
